      "answer": "ERR-4032 means that the invoice line item references a legacy tax code that no longer exists in BL2, because the migration could not map it automatically [HC-4002-baseline-003]. To fix this, you need to re-map the line item to a current tax code under Billing then Tax Codes, and then reissue the invoice [HC-4002-baseline-003]. When an invoice is corrected and reissued, it keeps the original invoice number and gains a revision suffix, such as `EU-2026-0004417-R2` [HC-4002-baseline-001]. The revision suffix increments on every reissue [HC-4002-baseline-001].",
